          "text": "Thank you for accepting this term male neonate (born 39+2 weeks by SVD) who was admitted to the Neonatal Unit at 6 hours of age with grunting, tachypnoea (RR 70) and a temperature of 38.1°C, and was treated for clinical neonatal sepsis.",
